{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55339","headline":"落星寺诗 · 修睦","name":"落星寺诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"是岳皆游遍，南来吴楚间。\n偶登湖里寺，疑到（《大典》作「是」）海中山。\n独树蒨萝（《庐山记》作「倩罗」，今从《大典》。\n）湿，遥汀白鸟闲。\n终须谢浮世，高卧听潺潺。\n（见《吉石盦丛书》影宋抄《庐山记》卷四，仅署名「同前」，其前缺一页，但存修睦《简寂观》诗之後半。\n《永乐大典》卷八七八二引《九江府志》正作修睦诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"修睦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}